weapons what are sometimes called tactical

00:02:26.909 --> 00:02:29.650
or battlefield nukes.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.140
And this is actually an area of concern.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.200
There are some who are hearing about this
and saying, Well, it's good that Russia doesn't

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:42.150
actually have or would would not use the big
nukes here.

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:48.939
But the way in which it could be a strategic
disadvantage is because Russia has those battlefield

00:02:48.939 --> 00:02:54.890
