supply of those.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:03:02.999
Putin knows Naito can't really respond with
those particular types of nukes.

00:03:02.999 --> 00:03:07.739
And this, the concern is, could actually be
a signal to Putin.

00:03:07.739 --> 00:03:13.889
If I do this, they're not going to drop like
the big boy on Russia.

00:03:13.889 --> 00:03:19.840
So therefore, it might be an opportunity to
use these types of nuclear weapons, tactical

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.180
nuclear weapons.

